DESCRIPTION:Ryan Charnoky: Sell Out. Ryan was a new comedian quietly figuri
 ng things out in Germany. Then millions of people started watching him wear
  an American eagle shirt and red cap around Europe\, confidently misunderst
 anding everything. Now he’s bringing a new stand-up show to Edinburgh abo
 ut the strange gap between real life and internet attention. Ryan talks abo
 ut fitting into Germany\, language\, emojis\, online comments\, cultural co
 nfusion and the humiliating process of becoming known as the dumbest Americ
 an in Europe.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/ryan-c
 harnoky-sell-out/
